[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8101.99, "timestamp": "02:15:01", "text": "就想要最新的版本之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8104.229, "timestamp": "02:15:04", "text": "我可以同时进行多路直播和多路直播工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8105.83, "timestamp": "02:15:05", "text": "一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8107.51, "timestamp": "02:15:07", "text": "那我觉得我就帮不了你了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8108.79, "timestamp": "02:15:08", "text": "因为我其实不太用那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8112.149, "timestamp": "02:15:12", "text": "笔记本电脑也很重要，你知道的。是啊，我也是。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8114.95, "timestamp": "02:15:14", "text": "那都是政治正确的事，没问题。我们可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8119.589, "timestamp": "02:15:19", "text": "只是升级一下零件之类的，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8123.91, "timestamp": "02:15:23", "text": "这是笔记本电脑。太令人困惑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8126.39, "timestamp": "02:15:26", "text": "你必须更换整个单元。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8129.27, "timestamp": "02:15:29", "text": "如果笔记本电脑出了问题，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8133.55, "timestamp": "02:15:33", "text": "正确的？这是令人悲哀的部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8138.35, "timestamp": "02:15:38", "text": "是的。这台笔记本电脑真让人头疼。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8141.51, "timestamp": "02:15:41", "text": "2025年了，你仍然没有办法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8144.79, "timestamp": "02:15:44", "text": "升级你的笔记本电脑。我认为有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8146.31, "timestamp": "02:15:46", "text": "不，只有一个，没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8148.709, "timestamp": "02:15:48", "text": "框架。你可以升级你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8151.99, "timestamp": "02:15:51", "text": "框架笔记本电脑。框架很好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8153.669, "timestamp": "02:15:53", "text": "男。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8155.91, "timestamp": "02:15:55", "text": "是的，很好。我听说是因为你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8158.229, "timestamp": "02:15:58", "text": "它可以完全模块化。所以你可以"}]